<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to game</a><div class="app t01"><aside class="rail panel" aria-label="Game controls"><div class="brand"><h1>Orchard Catch</h1><p class="lede">A gentle fruit-catching game.</p></div><dl class="stats stats--stack" aria-label="Game statistics"><div class="stat"><dt>Basket</dt><dd data-s02="caught">0 / 0</dd></div><div class="stat"><dt>Goal</dt><dd data-s02="goal">0</dd></div></dl><p class="message" data-s02="message" aria-live="polite">Move the basket to catch the fruit.</p>
